Description: Fits smooth and locally sparse scalar-on-function linear
    regression models with functional minimax concave penalty (fMCP),
    functional smoothly clipped absolute deviation (fSCAD), and adaptive
    regional folded-concave penalties. Single- and multi-resolution regional
    specifications can be fitted directly, while ARFC-Select chooses jointly
    among the MCP and SCAD penalty families and the two resolution structures
    using an explicitly supplied validation sample. Dense functional
    predictors are represented with B-splines. Computationally intensive
    matrix construction, regional norm evaluation, local quadratic
    approximation, tuning-path fitting, and model scoring are implemented with
    'RcppArmadillo'.
